# The design documents are the product and are hand-formatted — CONCEPT.md and DESIGN.md are written
# to a deliberate 100-column wrap with intentional emphasis markers. Prettier rewrites both. The
# decision log inherits that: each entry's body is a verbatim move out of CONCEPT.md.
*.md
!apps/web/**/*.md

# The operational notes are *not* design documents and stay Prettier-managed, which is where their
# aligned table pipes come from. They lived under `apps/web/` and were covered by the negation above
# until the docs moved into `docs/`; naming them keeps the move from silently changing who owns their
# formatting.
!docs/DEPLOY.md
!docs/ICONS.md

# Agent and tooling instructions are maintained upstream.
.claude/
openspec/
.remember/

# Licence texts are distributed verbatim.
apps/web/src/assets/fonts/OFL-*.txt

# Generated output: the generator owns its formatting. Running Prettier over it would couple the
# drift check to Prettier's version, so a Prettier upgrade would fail `just check` until every
# generated file was regenerated. The policy is general — jOOQ classes, openapi.json and the TS
# client are all committed generated artifacts too (CLAUDE.md, "Codegen chain").
**/generated/

# Cloudflare Pages config files are not a format Prettier understands.
apps/web/public/_headers
apps/web/public/_redirects
